      statement: "Third-party JS bundles under src/pretix/static/ are classified supply-chain first_party, inflating JS symbol totals and leaking vendored code into top-ranked symbols (pretix); an INV-nuzas-adjacent tier misclassification."  # 95ed
      root_cause: "Supply-chain tier classification treats any in-repo path as first_party without excluding vendored/static third-party asset directories, so bundled third-party JS under static/ is counted as first-party source."  # 95ed
